---
title: Workout Log
layout: 'base.njk'
---

{% set currentYear = collections.workoutArchiveYears | first %}
{% set allWorkouts = collections.workoutArchive %}
{% set currentYearWorkouts = allWorkouts | itemsForYear(currentYear) %}
{% set summary = allWorkouts | workoutSummary %}
{% set activityTypes = allWorkouts | workoutTypeSummary %}
{% set workoutChartItems = allWorkouts %}

<article class="main-article workout-log-page">
  <h1>Workout Log</h1>

  {% if currentYear %}
    <section class="workout-log-section">
      <h2 class="telegraph-section-title">Years</h2>
      <ul class="workout-year-links">
        {% for year in collections.workoutArchiveYears %}
          <li><a href="/workout/{{ year }}/">{{ year }}</a></li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    </section>

    {% include "workout-activity-charts.njk" %}

    <section class="workout-log-section">
      <h2 class="telegraph-section-title">Totals</h2>
      <p>I have logged a total of {{ summary.totalActivities | formatNumber }} workouts.</p>
      <p>Since I began tracking, I have recorded activity on {{ summary.activeDays | formatNumber }} out of {{ summary.totalDays | formatNumber }} days, which is {{ summary.percentActiveDays }}% of all days.</p>
      <p>Total active time is {{ summary.totalDurationLabel }}{% if summary.totalDistanceKm %} and I have covered {{ summary.totalDistanceKm }} km{% endif %}.</p>
      <p>My current streak is {{ summary.currentStreak }} days, while my longest streak so far is {{ summary.longestStreak }} days. The longest break I have taken is {{ summary.longestBreak }} days.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="workout-log-section">
      <h2 class="telegraph-section-title">Activity Types</h2>
      <div class="workout-type-grid">
        {% for item in activityTypes %}
          <article class="workout-type-card">
            <h3>{{ item.type }}</h3>
            <ul>
              <li>{{ item.activities | formatNumber }} activities</li>
              {% if item.durationLabel %}<li>{{ item.durationLabel }}</li>{% endif %}
              {% if item.distanceKm %}<li>{{ item.distanceKm }} km</li>{% endif %}
            </ul>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
  {% else %}
    <p>No workouts logged yet.</p>
  {% endif %}
</article>
